# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. Keys here are read by the Vite
# dev server only; never prefix a secret with VITE_, which would ship it to the browser.

# Live stock quotes on /debt.html and the phone's Stocks app (free key: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key).
# The dev server also reads the repo-root .env, so the key can live there instead.
# Free tier: 25 requests a day, so the server caches quotes for 6 hours in .cache/market/.
# Without a key the pages use the FRED snapshot in src/data/market.ts.
ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=
